   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "CADENCE (Kyiv time unless noted)\nevery 20 s ............ poller: active alerts (alerts.in.ua; Ubilling backup)\nevery 2 min ........... Telegram posts (Lab 3)\n04 · 10 · 16 · 22 ..... forecast_6h → M1, 6 hourly probabilities\neach Kyiv alert start . M2 duration via API (P50 / P90)\ndaily ................. drift + freshness checks (Lab 4)\nevery 2–3 weeks ....... make api-fetch (month_ago archive, ≤ 30 days back)\n1st of month (UTC) .... alerts_etl for the previous month → snapshot → train\non alarm .............. early retrain or FORCE_BASELINE",
   "originalText": "CADENCE (Kyiv time unless noted)\nevery 20 s ............ poller: active alerts (alerts.in.ua; Ubilling backup)\nevery 2 min ........... Telegram posts (Lab 3)\n04 · 10 · 16 · 22 ..... forecast_6h → M1, 6 hourly probabilities\neach Kyiv alert start . M2 duration via API (P50 / P90)\ndaily ................. drift + freshness checks (Lab 4)\nevery 2–3 weeks ....... make api-fetch (month_ago archive, ≤ 30 days back)\n1st of month (UTC) .... alerts_etl for the previous month → snapshot → train\non alarm .............. early retrain or FORCE_BASELINE",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "cadence",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
