   "text": "STATUS TODAY\nbuilt: alerts_etl, api-fetch, DVC, MinIO,\nPostgres, MLflow, training, M1 + M2 champions\nplanned: poller, forecast_6h, API,\nmonitoring (Lab 4), Telegram + M3 (Lab 3)",
